# The server, its fraud detection and the election audits are PRIVATE
# (github.com/HawkeyeNG/hawkeye-backend, since 2026-09-16). They are checked out
# here as their own repository at backend/ — tests in backend/tests, audits in
# backend/audits. .github/workflows/public-boundary.yml fails any push that
# brings them back.
/backend/
/audits/

node_modules/
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.claude/
tmp/
audit/reports/
audit/node_modules/
audit/C:*
audit/lighthouse.*

